00:47:11.200 --> 00:47:12.700
Same idea.

00:47:13.560 --> 00:47:18.440
I have y transpose xw minus that
same thing again,

00:47:18.440 --> 00:47:22.560
so I can maybe put a 2 here.

00:47:22.560 --> 00:47:26.000
And then plus, what's the final
term?

00:47:26.000 --> 00:47:29.340
xw transpose xw.

00:47:39.260 --> 00:47:44.510
And actually, let me not skip a
step here.

