00:56:23.660 --> 00:56:28.160
the gradient is a vector, so
this is the 0 vector.

00:56:30.480 --> 00:56:35.820
This negative 2 over n can be
multiplied into both sides and

00:56:35.820 --> 00:56:41.740
we can drop it, so we're just
left with x transpose y minus x

00:56:41.740 --> 00:56:45.500
transpose x w is equal to the 0
vector, and when and we

00:56:45.500 --> 00:56:46.500
