00:57:18.500 --> 00:57:19.500
Yeah,

00:57:20.560 --> 00:57:23.560
yeah, the normal equation.

00:57:31.220 --> 00:57:36.060
And what we saw before is that
the optimal parameter vector w

00:57:36.060 --> 00:57:39.740
is the solution to the normal
equation.

00:57:39.740 --> 00:57:43.160
There may be a unique solution
