00:57:54.780 --> 00:57:55.300
Yeah?

00:57:55.300 --> 00:57:57.550
x transpose x.
I mean,

00:57:57.740 --> 00:58:00.380
x transpose x is invertible.

00:58:00.380 --> 00:58:04.880
Yeah, if x transpose x is
invertible,

00:58:05.720 --> 00:58:09.940
i.e.
Let's see if x's columns are

00:58:09.940 --> 00:58:15.280
