00:58:20.360 --> 00:58:24.860
Then I can multiply both sides
by the inverse of x transpose x.

00:58:25.840 --> 00:58:30.880
And I get the exact same thing I
had before.

00:58:30.880 --> 00:58:31.880
Oh,

00:58:31.940 --> 00:58:33.200
that's what happened.

00:58:33.200 --> 00:58:34.200
OK.

00:58:35.280 --> 00:58:36.040
OK,

00:58:36.040 --> 00:58:39.540
so this is not that surprising.
This was the answer we were

00:58:39.540 --> 00:58:41.080
